@port = 5121
@host = http://localhost:{{port}}

### 1. Add a New Address
POST {{host}}/api/address
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..BS9CHH3v2Si_pcHVLr-aXJn755F7pda5iOh9qlQumqk

{
  "label": "Home",
  "fullAddress": "D-503 Darshanam Crest, Tarsali",
  "pinCode": "390004"
}

### 2. Get My Addresses
GET {{host}}/api/address
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..BS9CHH3v2Si_pcHVLr-aXJn755F7pda5iOh9qlQumqk

### 3. Delete an Address (Replace ID with one generated from the POST request)
DELETE {{host}}/api/address/01a0b4d6-5a9d-778e-b0f1-73d1856e4a1b
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..BS9CHH3v2Si_pcHVLr-aXJn755F7pda5iOh9qlQumqk